---
import ContentLayout from '@layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@config/site';
---

<ContentLayout
  title={`Contact ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`Get in touch with the ${SITE.name} team — report a correction, request a calculator you cannot find, ask a question, or tell us what is missing.`}
  path="/contact"
  heading="Contact us"
>
  <p>
    We'd love to hear from you. Whether you've spotted an error, want a new calculator
    built, or have feedback on an existing tool, your message helps us improve.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    Reach us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>. We aim
    to reply within a few business days.
  </p>

  <h2>Report a correction</h2>
  <p>
    Accuracy matters to us. If a calculator returns a result you believe is wrong,
    please email us with the tool name, the values you entered, the result you got and
    the result you expected. Corrections are treated as a priority.
  </p>

  <h2>Request a calculator</h2>
  <p>
    Is there a calculator you wish existed? Tell us what you need and how you'd use it.
    Reader requests directly shape our roadmap.
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
